# CMDEDIT-MISC-01: xor of identical cells; overlapping offset metal1; different types; xor -nolabels -novendor (Q-CMDEDIT-94, 95).
# Hefesto script (hefesto-cli --diagnostics=magic): the same commands.
tech load input/tiny -noprompt
load a
load b
box 0 0 10 10
paint metal1
save b
load a
box 0 0 10 10
paint metal1
xor b
save a
load d
box 5 0 15 10
paint metal1
save d
load c
box 0 0 10 10
paint metal1
xor d
save c
load f
box 0 0 10 10
paint poly
save f
load e
box 0 0 10 10
paint metal1
box 5 5 5 5
label E
xor -nolabels -novendor f
save e
writeall force
